This product includes software and design inspiration developed by third parties:

1. dsh-context (https://github.com/bowenliang123/dsh-context)
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   The feature set, interaction model and several token-accounting conventions in this
   project are adapted from dsh-context. The implementation here targets ZCode's session
   store and MCP Apps host contract instead of DeepSeek Harness projections.

2. ZCode (https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode)
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   UI_PLUGIN.md and the host source define the MCP Apps surface, session metadata and
   data-retention semantics this plugin follows.

3. models.dev (https://models.dev)
   The bundled model catalog in src/shared/models.json is a compact snapshot of the
   models.dev public API, used for list-price estimates and context-window fallbacks.
   No model data is fetched at runtime.

4. DeepSeek image-token calculator
   The attachment token estimate is a port of the public DeepSeek vision token
   calculator (14px patches, 3:1 downsampling, 384-token cap).

